        "id": 9893,
        "name": "jmrburgard",
        "username": "jmrburgard",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-15T00:20:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If Parse provides her +1 bonus to Fanatic and she uses her base per is that 2/1 or 2/2? I remember seeing an answer to this kind of question before but cannot find it.</p><p>Also, if she gives the bonus to K.N.Y.F.E. who then plays the card that lasts her do 1/1 to up to three targets does that end up being 2/2 x3, 2/1 x3, 2/2 then 1/1 x2, or 2/1 then 1/1x2? I know it doesn't last to a second card/power but wonder how far it got on a single one.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:47.964Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
