        "raw": "<p>If Parse provides her +1 bonus to Fanatic and she uses her base per is that 2/1 or 2/2? I remember seeing an answer to this kind of question before but cannot find it.</p><p>Also, if she gives the bonus to K.N.Y.F.E. who then plays the card that lasts her do 1/1 to up to three targets does that end up being 2/2 x3, 2/1 x3, 2/2 then 1/1 x2, or 2/1 then 1/1x2? I know it doesn&#39;t last to a second card/power but wonder how far it got on a single one.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
